  "<span class=\"c-accent\">3x + 4y = {@0}</span> · <span class=\"c-ok\">x² + y² = 25</span> · {@1}": "<span class=\"c-accent\">3x + 4y = {@0}</span> · <span class=\"c-ok\">x² + y² = 25</span> · {@1}",
  "<span class=\"c-accent\">T<sub>{@0}</sub>(x) = {@1}</span> · chyba v bode x = π: |sin π − T<sub>{@2}</sub>(π)| = {@3}": "<span class=\"c-accent\">T<sub>{@0}</sub>(x) = {@1}</span> · погрешность в точке x = π: |sin π − T<sub>{@2}</sub>(π)| = {@3}",
  "<span class=\"c-accent\">s<sub>{@0}</sub> = {@1}</span> · ln 2 ≈ {@2} · skutočná chyba {@3} ≤ a<sub>{@4}</sub> = 1/{@5} ≈ {@6}": "<span class=\"c-accent\">s<sub>{@0}</sub> = {@1}</span> · ln 2 ≈ {@2} · фактическая погрешность {@3} ≤ a<sub>{@4}</sub> = 1/{@5} ≈ {@6}",
  "<span class=\"c-accent\">vrstevnica x²/4 + y² = {@0}</span> · elipsa s poloosami a = 2√c ≈ {@1} a b = √c ≈ {@2}": "<span class=\"c-accent\">линия уровня x²/4 + y² = {@0}</span> · эллипс с полуосями a = 2√c ≈ {@1} и b = √c ≈ {@2}",
  "<span class=\"c-accent\">z ≈ {@0} {@1} {@2}i</span> = {@3}·(cos {@4}° + i sin {@5}°) ·": "<span class=\"c-accent\">z ≈ {@0} {@1} {@2}i</span> = {@3}·(cos {@4}° + i sin {@5}°) ·",
  "A; B": "A; B",
